  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy Kits for Opportunities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to provide access to energy, Rural Spark B.V. provides plug &amp; play energy solutions (the Rural Spark Energy Kit) to local distribution companies in Sub-Saharan Africa. To be able to provide these partners, Rural Spark will have to shorten its delivery time. Having to produce on order, the lead time would be 6 months, restricting our partners to place an order. With DGGF-TA Rural Spark was able to produce and ship them to a warehouse in Mumbai, from where delivery times are shortened to a month. With this DGGF-TA, 3 local staff were supported, as well as 275 sub-agents in DR Congo, Kenya and Senegal. A total of 120 people were trained on how to use the product, as well as how to carry out technical services and sales techniques. The Rural Spark solution enables households and small businesses to gain access to electricity, providing a world of opportunities related to improving income, health and education.</narrative>
  </description>
